+# exp-app
+
+Tiny full-stack demo:
+
+- Backend: Express + Sequelize (SQLite)
+- Frontend: React + Vite
+
+## Dev
+
+From the repo root:
+
+- Install: `npm install`
+- Run both: `npm run dev`
+
+Or run individually:
+
+- Backend: `npm run dev:backend`
+- Frontend: `npm run dev:frontend`
+
+## Backend config
+
+Environment variables:
+
+- `PORT` (default: `3001`)
+- `DB_STORAGE` (default: `:memory:`)
+- `SQL_LOGGING` (`true` to enable Sequelize SQL logs)
+
